      hu: ["A színház ünnepélyes megnyitójára 1915. április 15-én került sor.", "A főtermet a híres spanyol drámaíróról, Federico García Lorcáról nevezték el.", "A homlokzaton négy nagy szoborcsoport található Giuseppe Moretti munkájaként.", "Az intézmény 1960 óta a Kubai Nemzeti Balett állandó otthona.", "Az épületet eredetileg a galíciai bevándorlók közössége építtette központként.", "Alicia Alonso tiszteletére 2015-ben vette fel a művésznő nevét a színház."],
      ro: ["Teatrul a fost inaugurat oficial la data de 15 aprilie 1915.", "Sala principală poartă numele poetului și dramaturgului Federico García Lorca.", "Cele patru grupuri statuare de pe fațadă au fost create de Giuseppe Moretti.", "Clădirea a fost sediul Centrului Galician din Havana înainte de revoluție.", "Capacitatea totală a sălii principale este de 1.500 de locuri pe mai multe niveluri.", "Redenumirea oficială după Alicia Alonso a avut loc în anul 2015."],
      en: ["The theatre was officially inaugurated on April 15, 1915.", "The main auditorium is named after the Spanish poet Federico García Lorca.", "The facade features four marble sculpture groups by artist Giuseppe Moretti.", "It has served as the permanent headquarters for the National Ballet of Cuba since 1960.", "The building was originally funded by the Galician immigrant community in Havana.", "The name was changed to honor Alicia Alonso by official decree in 2015."],
